room-booking-service manages different rooms in a hotel. Each room has various basic features such as the number of beds, view, and size. It also includes optional features such as a personal spa area or the best view option. Only the best view option is available for two-bed rooms. The managing system also manages the bookings. Each booking contains the start and end dates, as well as optional fees and bookings.

Note that UVL Code does not support the "best-view" feature directly. Instead, it can be represented using additional attributes or fields if needed.